### --help | head -20
CLI client for Aomi on-chain agent (aomi v0.7.0)

USAGE

  aomi
  aomi --prompt <prompt> [OPTIONS]
  aomi [OPTIONS] <command>

ROOT MODES

  aomi                         Start the interactive REPL
  aomi --prompt "hello"        Send one prompt and exit

REPL COMMANDS

  /heap                        Show REPL help
  /app <name>                  Switch the active app
  /model <rig>|list|show       Manage the active model
  /key <provider:key>|show|clear
                               Manage BYOK provider keys
EXIT(help)=0

